        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "甚至呢，可能失眠，而且呢，脾气还特别大。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 12.248,
      "end": 15.259,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "欧巴式呢就发点脾气，这是什么表现呢？",
      "score": 0.2872,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2033,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1614,
        "sc_delta": 0.0419,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.227,
        "seg_cer": 0.188,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "式/四",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "九八四呢，就发点脾气，这是什么表现呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 15.259,
      "end": 17.548,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "很可能喊作伤春。",
      "score": 0.2306,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0246,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0303,
        "sc_delta": -0.0057,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.286,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "春/存",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "很可能喊作“尚存”。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 17.816,
      "end": 22.379,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那什么是个伤春呢？啷子科学来缓解这个伤春，",
      "score": 0.0481,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0281,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0235,
        "sc_delta": 0.0046,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.105,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那什么是个上春呢？啷子科学来缓解这个上春。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 22.379,
      "end": 25.528,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "调节自己情绪呢？我们一起啊一块了解一下。",
      "score": 0.647,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5326,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5242,
        "sc_delta": 0.0085,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.278,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "调干自己情绪的，我们先啊，一个了解一下。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 27.323,
      "end": 32.215,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "什么喊作伤春呢？伤春呐是一种季节性的情绪病，",
      "score": 0.1033,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1169,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1337,
        "sc_delta": -0.0168,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.023,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "什么喊作上唇呢？上唇呐，是一种季节性的情绪病。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 32.305,
      "end": 34.878,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "在春季时候冷暖交替的时候呢，",
      "score": 0.546,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.4369,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4227,
